                <pb facs="0752" n="738" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg738"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barlow, United States marshal, to Mr. Hoar,
                        Attorney-General.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi>
                        10, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Attorney-General</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Will you telegraph the Connecticut marshal to take charge of the Spanish
                    gun-boats at Mystic? He thinks he requires orders from you.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FRANCIS C. BARLOW,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States
                            Marshal.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
